ring Consultants** — a **Rs 4.30 cr Letter of Acceptance from Maharashtra Airport Development Company** to act as consultant for forest diversion, revenue coordination and statutory clearances for the proposed Gadchiroli greenfield airport _(~1.1% of mcap)_.","**Happy Square Outsourcing (White Force)** — a third extension of its MPPTCL Shivpuri work order, **approximately Rs 1.27 cr inclusive of taxes**, covering six months from 1 October 2026; the order was first awarded in 2023 and extended twice in 2025.","**Power Grid Corporation of India Limited** — POWERGRID declared as successful bidder under TBCB","**Innovision Ltd** — Intimation of Workorder received from NHAI for Mangapatnam Toll in the state of Andhra Pradesh","**Marc Technocrats Limited** — Marc Technocrats Limited has informed the Exchange about Bagging/Receiving of orders/contracts"],"m_and_a":["**ACE Software Exports** — signs a **share purchase agreement for all 10,000 equity shares of QeApps Private Limited at Rs 12,000 a share**, which will make QeApps a wholly owned subsidiary; the filing states no aggregate — Rs 12.00 cr is our multiplication of its two figures.","**NLC India** — signs an **addendum to its Business Transfer Agreement with wholly owned NLC India Renewables to hive off 708.96 MW of renewable assets**, including a 4 MW green hydrogen project, for a consideration the filing does not disclose (cash or acknowledgement of debt, at book value).","**Rajputana Industries** — board approves acquiring **14.21% of Shera Global Ventures LLP for Rs 1.46 cr of equity plus Rs 6.74 cr as security contribution**, in cash, to procure renewable energy for captive consumption; the annexure records it as a related-party transaction at arm's length, two directors being designated partners of the target, an LLP incorporated on 2 June 2026.","**One Global Service Provider Ltd** — Please find attached letter regarding acquisition of 51% equity stake in Matrix Labs Diagnocare Private Limited and Matrix Labs